# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:5
translate italian cafechat2_c5150887:

    # "I hang around the café for a while, looking for anybody who might be up for a chat."
    "Rimango un po’ al bar, cercando qualcuno con cui fare due chiacchiere."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:6
translate italian cafechat2_dc97e0bf:

    # "After a while, a cute redhead woman comes in, orders a coffee, then sits by herself."
    "Dopo un po’, entra una ragazza carina dai capelli rossi, ordina un caffè e poi si siede da sola."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:9
translate italian cafechat2_f7020c42:

    # "She's writing in a small notebook, looking up occasionally to glance around the room."
    "Sta scrivendo su un piccolo taccuino, alzando lo sguardo di tanto in tanto per guardarsi intorno."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:10
translate italian cafechat2_625338d0:

    # "Our eyes meet for a moment and she smiles at me."
    "I nostri sguardi si incrociano per un attimo e lei mi sorride."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:11
translate italian cafechat2_9f7eb62a:

    # "I decide to make my move, getting up and walking towards her."
    "Decido di fare la mia mossa, alzandomi e avvicinandomi a lei."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:12
translate italian cafechat2_9b838a0b:

    # "She sees me approach and continues to smile."
    "Mi vede avvicinarmi e continua a sorridere."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:15
translate italian cafechat2_9799d541:

    # pc "Hey, I just saw you from across the cafe and thought to myself, \"I have to go talk to this beautiful woman.\""
    pc "Ehi, ti ho appena vista dall’altra parte del bar e mi sono detto: «Devo andare a parlare con questa bellissima donna»."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:16
translate italian cafechat2_070c6efc:

    # "Woman" "Wow, you are smooth."
    "Woman" "Wow, sei proprio un seduttore."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:17
translate italian cafechat2_1715b678:

    # "Woman" "Well have a seat and let's talk then."
    "Woman" "Beh, siediti e parliamo allora."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:18
translate italian cafechat2_399bdc0f:

    # pc "Really?"
    pc "Davvero?"

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:19
translate italian cafechat2_969cb3e3:

    # "I'm taken aback for a moment at how easy that had been."
    "Rimango un attimo sorpreso da quanto sia stato facile."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:20
translate italian cafechat2_badba3e0:

    # "Woman" "Really. My name is Claire by the way."
    "Woman" "Davvero. A proposito, mi chiamo Claire."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:21
translate italian cafechat2_cb77909a:

    # pc "I'm [pcname]."
    pc "Io sono [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:22
translate italian cafechat2_fa35bcdd:

    # cl "Nice to meet you, [pcname]."
    cl "Piacere di conoscerti, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:23
translate italian cafechat2_0a5e237b:

    # pc "So do you go to school here?"
    pc "Allora, frequenti l’università qui?"

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:24
translate italian cafechat2_aa0ef110:

    # "She lets out a little laugh."
    "Lei fa una risatina."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:25
translate italian cafechat2_3c028d10:

    # cl "You're cute."
    cl "Sei carino."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:26
translate italian cafechat2_ac233c18:

    # cl "I graduated a few years ago, but I like to come here every once in a while to have a latte and write a bit."
    cl "Mi sono laureata qualche anno fa, ma mi piace venire qui ogni tanto per bere un latte macchiato e scrivere un po’."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:27
translate italian cafechat2_0f5b1f57:

    # pc "You're a writer?"
    pc "Sei una scrittrice?"

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:28
translate italian cafechat2_1d71c056:

    # cl "For the Skyhill Tribune."
    cl "Per lo Skyhill Tribune."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:29
translate italian cafechat2_657e0b70:

    # pc "Oh a journalist?"
    pc "Oh, una giornalista?"

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:30
translate italian cafechat2_0ea2a97b:

    # cl "That's right."
    cl "Esatto."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:31
translate italian cafechat2_30b8f086:

    # cl "Now it's my turn. What are you doing here, besides trying to pick up women?"
    cl "Ora tocca a me. Cosa ci fai qui, a parte cercare di rimorchiare ragazze?"

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:32
translate italian cafechat2_95ca4963:

    # pc "Well I do go to school here, but yeah I was just hanging around the café trying to meet somebody. You got me."
    pc "Beh, frequento l’università qui, ma sì, stavo solo bighellonando al bar cercando di conoscere qualcuno. Mi hai beccato."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:33
translate italian cafechat2_dbb6b07b:

    # cl "Nothing wrong with that. You're a young, good-looking guy. I'm sure you could pick up a few of these college girls that hang around the café."
    cl "Non c’è niente di male in questo. Sei un ragazzo giovane e di bell’aspetto. Sono sicura che potresti rimorchiare qualche studentessa che bazzica al bar."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:34
translate italian cafechat2_4ed8ccca:

    # pc "You'd think so, but I haven't had much luck."
    pc "Si direbbe di sì, ma non ho avuto molta fortuna."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:37
translate italian cafechat2_4fbcfe0e:

    # cl "Well you got lucky today."
    cl "Beh, oggi sei stato fortunato."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:38
translate italian cafechat2_d72509a6:

    # pc "Yeah?"
    pc "Davvero?"

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:39
translate italian cafechat2_b287ca61:

    # cl "Yeah. I'd go out with a stud like you any night of the week."
    cl "Sì. Uscirei con uno stallone come te qualsiasi sera della settimana."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:40
translate italian cafechat2_070ec879:

    # pc "You want to go out then?"
    pc "Allora vuoi uscire?"

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:41
translate italian cafechat2_703e945d:

    # cl "How about tomorrow night? You take me out for dinner and we'll see where that goes?"
    cl "Che ne dici di domani sera? Mi porti fuori a cena e vediamo come va?"

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:42
translate italian cafechat2_7547e9a7:

    # pc "Sounds good to me. You ever had Jackson Burger?"
    pc "Per me va bene. Hai mai provato il Jackson Burger?"

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:43
translate italian cafechat2_feddb963:

    # cl "That old burger joint downtown? Yeah, I think I had them a few years back."
    cl "Quel vecchio locale di hamburger in centro? Sì, credo di averci mangiato qualche anno fa."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:44
translate italian cafechat2_1bc6a483:

    # pc "Want to meet me there?"
    pc "Ti va di incontrarci lì?"

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:45
translate italian cafechat2_c99d0cc2:

    # cl "You sure know how to charm a lady."
    cl "Sai davvero come affascinare una donna."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:46
translate italian cafechat2_a6b7aa6b:

    # cl "Sure, that sounds good."
    cl "Certo, mi sembra un'ottima idea."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:47
translate italian cafechat2_175a10a1:

    # pc "Great. Say about eight??"
    pc "Fantastico. Che ne dici di verso le otto??"

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:48
translate italian cafechat2_d5121909:

    # cl "I'll be there."
    cl "Ci sarò."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:49
translate italian cafechat2_852e0dc5:

    # pc "I'll see you there then. I'll let you get back to your work."
    pc "Ci vediamo lì allora. Ti lascio tornare al tuo lavoro."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:50
translate italian cafechat2_535522c2:

    # cl "All right stud. See you later."
    cl "Va bene, fusto. Ci vediamo più tardi."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:53
translate italian cafechat2_23f27a9b:

    # "I walk away from her, feeling triumphant."
    "Mi allontano da lei, sentendomi trionfante."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:54
translate italian cafechat2_42e1608c:

    # "I hadn't had to do much talking to convince her to go out on a date with me, but it had still been a major confidence boost."
    "Non avevo dovuto parlare molto per convincerla a uscire con me, ma era stata comunque una grande iniezione di fiducia."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:55
translate italian cafechat2_cbeb0c08:

    # "She is really cute and seems to think that I was good-looking as well."
    "È davvero carina e sembra che anche lei mi trovi attraente."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:56
translate italian cafechat2_9ce2477c:

    # "I actually have a chance to sleep with her tomorrow night."
    "In realtà domani sera ho la possibilità di andare a letto con lei."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:64
translate italian cafechat2_23905a1b:

    # "I'm so excited about it I can hardly think about anything else as I leave the café and head to class."
    "Sono così eccitato all’idea che riesco a malapena a pensare ad altro mentre esco dal bar e mi dirigo verso l’aula."

# game/Scenes/CafeChats/cafechat2.rpy:67
translate italian cafechat2_4a7a70ef:

    # "I'm so excited about it I can hardly think about anything else as I leave the café and head out to my car."
    "Sono così eccitato all’idea che riesco a malapena a pensare ad altro mentre esco dal bar e mi dirigo verso la mia auto."

